Adapt Google Cloud CLI to the ruamel.yaml 0.18+ API.
Replace deprecated module-level YAML loading and dumping functions with
the YAML() instance API. Preserve safe and round-trip processing, YAML
version selection, formatting options, and custom tag handling.
Required for compatibility with system-installed dev-python/ruamel-yaml
when unbundling Google Cloud CLI's vendored Python dependencies.
